TNT1 A 1 A_GiveToTarget("FireFlameSwordU_P1")
TNT1 A 1 A_GiveToTarget("FireFlameSwordU_P2")
TNT1 A 1 A_GiveToTarget("FireFlameSwordU_P3")
TNT1 A 1 A_GiveToTarget("FireFlameSwordU_P4")
